MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8de559a088a5d4d48bb00ae8ccc21165, type: 3}
  m_Name: Financial Crisis
  crisisName: Financial Crisis
  ominousWarningText: "Trade is beginning to falter. Merchants who once extended credit freely now demand coin in advance, while lenders quietly shorten repayment terms and refuse risks they would have accepted only months ago. Warehouses fill with goods that cannot find buyers, and ships remain in harbor longer while captains wait for contracts that never arrive. Wealthy families move their savings into safer holdings, draining coin from markets already struggling to complete ordinary transactions. Officials insist that commerce remains fundamentally sound, but conversations in counting houses grow increasingly nervous."
  obviousWarningText: "Credit has collapsed. Merchants rush to recover their coin before more lenders close their doors, while businesses that depended on borrowed money suddenly find themselves unable to pay workers or purchase supplies. Contracts are abandoned, ships sit idle, and markets that once connected distant regions grind toward paralysis. A handful of failures have become a chain reaction as each institution tries to protect itself from the weakness of the next. Crowds gather outside banks and counting houses demanding access to deposits that may no longer exist in liquid form."
  ominousWarningTurns: 1
  obviousWarningTurns: 1
  durationTurns: 8
  useAgeWindow: 1
  minimumAge: 10
  maximumAge: 19
  mechanic: 6
